    "physicalNotes": [
      "C1 is a 1 F, 5.5 V supercapacitor, precharged to 4.7 V for the hold-up run. Its manufacturer maximum charge current is 1.5 mA; limit the external supply to no more than 1.5 mA while charging.",
      "The 10.20 mm capacitor pin spacing maps to BB400 F14-F18, whose hole centers are 10.16 mm apart. Check lead alignment and insert without force.",
      "The board has no internal charge limiter. Never connect its input to an unlimited-current source. Disable or disconnect the input supply to begin the hold-up interval.",
      "The ideal discharge model omits capacitor ESR, tolerance, leakage, recharge behavior, temperature and load dynamics."
